{
 "id": "it-IT",
 "$comment": "Ctrl chords of the Italian layout, matched on KeyboardEvent.code. On this layout '-' is on Slash, 'ì' on Equal, 'è' on BracketLeft, '+' on BracketRight, 'ò' on Semicolon, 'à' on Quote, 'ù' on Backslash, ''' on Minus and '\\' on Backquote. AltGr arrives as Ctrl+Alt: the characters in altGrChars never trigger Ctrl bindings. 'else' has no chord.",
 "altGrChars": ["[", "]", "{", "}", "@", "#", "€", "|"],
